      "value": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.YaIyoJQt2OtMAVOW]{Daily Divination}</p><p>A Diviner has read you a fortune for the day. You gain a status bonus to one Exploration or Downtime Activity for the day if it is using the proficiency modifier that is matching the suit of the card drawn. Once used, the effect ends and you are immune to bonuses from Daily Divination until your next daily preparations.</p>"
